X-Bundle-Update-Library-Info: Fixed member selection of the 'iSphere Synchronize Members' editor.
X-Bundle-Info: Fixed 'IllegalArgumentException' on disposed images in 'iSphere Synchronize Members' and 'iSphere Compare Message Files' editors.\nFixed NPE when closing the 'iSphere Synchronize Members' editor.\nFixed problem that members where not selected in the iSphere Synchronize Members editor if the mask filter is a 1-filter negated-mask.\nFixed 'NumberFormatException' when exporting journal entries to Excel.
